msgid "LightWare SF10 and SF11 Lidar"
msgstr "LightWare SF10 和 SF11 激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:7
#: 0f8aa7d273d8427e88713a75ddab17fa 24a7a3c3433044719028a2deb6d4bcc2
#: 38db8caa2aa34193b3270a0765d1ec08 602d35ca7f4a4768b5097af75ea3e76a
#: e088f1449b124aa39dadba49c416db2f
msgid ""
"The `Lightware SF10 and SF11 <https://lightware.co.za/collections/lidar-"
"rangefinders>`__ series of laser rangefinders are particularly lightweight, "
"and provide fast and accurate distance measurements. Although slightly more "
"expensive than other rangefinders, members of the dev team have had good "
"success with them. The series includes a number of models: `SF10/A "
"<http://pixhawkstore.com.au/sf10-a-lightware-25m-laser-altimeter/>`__ (25m),"
" `SF10/B <http://pixhawkstore.com.au/sf10-b-lightware-50m-laser-"
"altimeter/>`__ (50m), SF10/C (100m) and `SF11/C "
"<https://lightware.co.za/collections/lidar-"
"rangefinders/products/sf11-c-120-m>`__ (120m)"
msgstr ""
"`Lightware SF10 和 SF11 <https://lightware.co.za/collections/lidar-"
"rangefinders>`__ "
"系列激光测距仪特别轻量，提供快速准确的距离测量。虽然比其他测距仪稍贵，但开发团队成员使用效果良好。该系列包含多种型号：`SF10/A "
"<http://pixhawkstore.com.au/sf10-a-lightware-25m-laser-altimeter/>`__ "
"（25m）、`SF10/B <http://pixhawkstore.com.au/sf10-b-lightware-50m-laser-"
"altimeter/>`__ （50m）、SF10/C（100m）和 `SF11/C "
"<https://lightware.co.za/collections/lidar-"
"rangefinders/products/sf11-c-120-m>`__ （120m）"

