msgid "Connecting to the AutoPilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:20
#: 2e289c57df92429a9dd8a5f2620107df 6a9b601f3ffc4cbe9a3ace49ed0b5b68
#: 6d3cdd12d7574b46a6e73347d213f25f 7dd990a64a1c4675955122d87ea49b1b
#: ea92b38ba23945a797069fa21c51a84c
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The diagram below shows the sensor output pins and a conveniently colour-"
"coded cable (normally included or `see spec here "
"<http://documents.lightware.co.za/LW%20000_135%20-%20Main%20cable%20type%201%20assembly%20-%20Rev%200.pdf>`__)"
" which is used to connect to the autopilot. :ref:`Serial <sf10-serial-"
"connection>`, :ref:`I2C <sf10-i2c-connection>` and :ref:`Analog "
"<sf10-analog-connection>` connections are possible but we recommended using "
":ref:`Serial <sf10-serial-connection>` if possible especially if using "
"cables that are 30cm or longer."
msgstr ""
"下图显示传感器输出引脚和方便识别的彩色线缆（通常包含在内或 `查看规格 "
"<http://documents.lightware.co.za/LW%20000_135%20-%20Main%20cable%20type%201%20assembly%20-%20Rev%200.pdf>`__"
" `），用于连接到飞控。:ref:`串口 <sf10-serial-connection>`、:ref:`I2C "
"<sf10-i2c-connection>` 和 :ref:`模拟 <sf10-analog-connection>` 连接均可，但建议尽量使用 "
":ref:`串口 <sf10-serial-connection>`，尤其是使用 30cm 或更长线缆时。"

