":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **25** (for SF10A), **50** (for SF10B), "
"**100** (for SF10C) or **120** (for SF11C).  *This is the distance in meters"
" that the rangefinder can reliably read. The value depends on the model of "
"the lidar.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **25** （SF10A）、**50** （SF10B）、**100** "
"（SF10C）或 **120** （SF11C）。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。具体值取决于激光雷达型号。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:128
