#: c13c8502f04f484595e41f2d4d57d357 cd06ab2e4e12416ea07db1fa004b05a7
#: dc6b604642b14a4ab6b5c6d2d4e25ffd
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更精确地，飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:65
#: 12ed30a0fc534aaaad14bc1a18f78e04 6d2a3906322a47c6856de988c75f8ce7
#: a1a2838c077c40bc83357704060ff6ea b16f56f23e4e4542a82a469d6c019d92
#: c8867c10cc7749f0b6caf9666ac53262
msgid ""
"If you instead were using the Telem2 port on the Pixhawk then you would set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9, and :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD "
"<SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr ""
"如果改用 Pixhawk 的 Telem2 端口，则应设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"9，以及 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:67
#: 6e250e7df1b446829608fad73c99c780 817295af07c6469882d375102a667557
#: 846485295d6343899097710742bcc79b 8fe24c27766d463280466478c8f233fe
#: f3d8cfb700ff4e7f9ab8fc138ac4b6c1
msgid ""
"Lightware lidars manufactured before May 2018 shipped with a default baud "
"rate of 19200. If your device was produced before this date, you will need "
"to set the baud rate to 19200 (Parameter value 19). Alternatively, you may "
"reconfigure your lightware device to use a baudrate of 115200 using the "
"Lightware Terminal application and use the settings above."
msgstr ""
"2018 年 5 月前生产的 Lightware 激光雷达出厂默认波特率为 19200。如果您的设备在此日期前生产，则需要将波特率设置为 "
"19200（参数值 19）。或者，您可以使用 Lightware Terminal 应用程序将 Lightware 设备重新配置为 115200 "
"波特率，然后使用上述设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:72
#: 1031f50f9b0d4a74a88590a8579012a9 52499adb47ff467ebf675b86d08685dc
#: 5a840688a4314979b1b012e17b3076fd 92e50ec8ab50427bb2af3e6830552385
#: ec7cf09ea12543cc9f31e9615c8e7d30
msgid "I2C connection"
msgstr "I2C 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:74
#: 05e8b10bb38c4f4b91189452f09efd15 3801b6e612034000aa3c26bf4bed5b67
#: 717b4e180c2143cf8e5c5f6d639a6388 b5b41df6bc964b7f8233f32424ec8a69
#: f86a26979c684bb7bd758ee7930ae141
msgid ""
"Connect the SDA line of the Lidar to the SDA line of the I2C port on the "
"Pixhawk, and the SCL line of the Lidar to the SCL line of the I2C port. Also"
" connect the GND and 5V lines."
msgstr ""
"将激光雷达的 SDA 线连接到 Pixhawk I2C 端口的 SDA 线，将激光雷达的 SCL 线连接到 I2C 端口的 SCL 线，同时连接 GND"
" 和 5V 线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:79
