#: e40789470f4f4a22a50f28770afdd285
msgid ""
"It may be necessary to enable the sensor's \"I2C compatibility mode "
"(Pixhawk)\".  This can be done by connecting the lidar to your PC using a "
"USB cable, then download `Lightware Studio "
"<https://lightwarelidar.com/pages/lightware-studio>`__, connect and check "
"the checkbox shown below"
msgstr ""
"可能需要启用传感器的 「I2C 兼容模式（Pixhawk）」。方法是将激光雷达通过 USB 线缆连接到电脑，然后下载 `Lightware Studio"
" <https://lightwarelidar.com/pages/lightware-studio>`__，连接后勾选下图所示的复选框"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:100
#: 43929d2b7f7e47688458a6926211cbe6 614bedb851874bc49e76960e9db24fce
#: 73315a820fbd45a1897ea295f9b8fbec 74fa3e2d44a04816939675307258c5c7
#: a8bb800a1a5d40778ea53f49ebc87b33
msgid ""
"The default I2C address was 85 (0x55 in hexadecimal) on older LightWare "
"rangefinders. This was changed to prevent conflict with another device on "
"ArduPilot. Please check your rangefinder system settings to determine what "
"your I2C address is."
msgstr ""
"旧版 LightWare 测距仪的默认 I2C 地址为 85（十六进制 0x55）。该地址已被修改，以避免与 ArduPilot "
"上的其他设备冲突。请检查您的测距仪系统设置以确认 I2C 地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:107
