#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf10-lidar.rst:109
#: 2da275437ca741ca8cd2e6eeceb7fda3 320e51af26154256860aee1f48c8a7ed
#: c199e9bd1a414b769c7a3c8ae7469c75 c81ea5a490634642a7a11f1d9d290639
#: f6c25f10b9e64bd3a485a8314e6de12d
msgid ""
"The SF10's Analog Out pin (5) should be connected to the Pixhawk's 3.3V ADC "
"(analog to digital converter).  The Pixhawk will provide the regulated 5V "
"power supply needed by the sensor using the 5V and GND pins of the ADC "
"connector."
msgstr ""
"SF10 的模拟输出引脚（5）应连接到 Pixhawk 的 3.3V ADC（模数转换器）。Pixhawk 将通过 ADC 连接器的 5V 和 GND "
"引脚为传感器提供所需的稳压 5V 供电。"

